  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "1 采样与数据质量",
    "text_level": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      95,
      928,
      149
    ],
    "page_idx": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "1.1 采样间隔与时间戳",
    "text_level": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      163,
      928,
      217
    ],
    "page_idx": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "采样间隔 Δt 是相邻两次观测时间戳之差。均匀采样要求大多数相邻间隔接近设定值，但网络抖动可能让到达时间偏离采集时间，因此必须区分设备时间戳和服务器接收时间。",
    "text_level": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      231,
      928,
      285
    ],
    "page_idx": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "equation",
    "img_path": "images/601b6a600ec9d103188879e18c33166a9b368ca84ae13fa9bc7eca702b582da5.png",
    "text": "$$\nf_s = \\frac{1}{\\Delta t}\n$$",
    "text_format": "latex",
    "bbox": [
      72,
      299,
      928,
      353
    ],
    "page_idx": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "例如每 5 秒采集一次，理论采样频率为 0.2 Hz。判断遗漏记录时应比较时间戳间隔，而不能只统计当前文件共有多少行。",
    "text_level": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      367,
      928,
      421
    ],
    "page_idx": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "list",
    "sub_type": "text",
    "list_items": [
      "时间戳统一到同一时区",
      "保留原始时间与校正时间",
      "记录允许的采样抖动范围"
    ],
    "bbox": [
      72,
      435,
      928,
      489
    ],
    "page_idx": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "header",
    "text": "COURSE STUDIO / 传感器数据校验入门",
    "bbox": [
      65,
      24,
      600,
      48
    ],
    "page_idx": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "footer",
    "text": "原创测试教材 · 仿 MinerU 结构化产物",
    "bbox": [
      65,
      948,
      610,
      972
    ],
    "page_idx": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "page_number",
    "text": "3",
    "bbox": [
      900,
      948,
      940,
      972
    ],
    "page_idx": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "1.2 缺失值与异常值",
    "text_level": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      95,
      928,
      149
    ],
    "page_idx": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "缺失值表示本应存在的观测没有获得；异常值表示获得了数值，但数值违反物理范围或变化规律。二者的处理策略不同，不能把所有可疑值都直接改成零。",
    "text_level": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      163,
      928,
      217
    ],
    "page_idx": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "table",
    "img_path": "images/3e29072ca23c4d36458a01648ff31e518a51046f58b0c959b9aafb51e38ce858.png",
    "table_caption": [
      "表 1 数据质量状态"
    ],
    "table_footnote": [
      "阈值必须结合传感器量程与业务场景设定。"
    ],
    "table_body": "<table><thead><tr><th>状态</th><th>示例</th><th>推荐动作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>有效</td><td>22.4 ℃</td><td>保留</td></tr><tr><td>缺失</td><td>时间戳存在但无读数</td><td>标记并评估插值</td></tr><tr><td>越界</td><td>温度 310 ℃</td><td>隔离并检查设备</td></tr><tr><td>突变</td><td>一分钟上升 35 ℃</td><td>结合邻近记录复核</td></tr></tbody></table>",
    "bbox": [
      72,
      231,
      928,
      285
    ],
    "page_idx": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "边界检查",
    "text_level": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      299,
      928,
      353
    ],
    "page_idx": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "恰好等于量程上限的数值是否有效，取决于规范采用闭区间还是开区间。规则必须写进配置并保持可追踪。",
    "text_level": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      367,
      928,
      421
    ],
    "page_idx": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "header",
    "text": "COURSE STUDIO / 传感器数据校验入门",
    "bbox": [
      65,
      24,
      600,
      48
    ],
    "page_idx": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "footer",
    "text": "原创测试教材 · 仿 MinerU 结构化产物",
    "bbox": [
      65,
      948,
      610,
      972
    ],
    "page_idx": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "page_number",
    "text": "4",
    "bbox": [
      900,
      948,
      940,
      972
    ],
    "page_idx": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "2 平滑与告警",
    "text_level": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      95,
      928,
      149
    ],
    "page_idx": 4
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "2.1 移动平均",
    "text_level": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      163,
      928,
      217
    ],
    "page_idx": 4
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "移动平均使用最近 w 个有效观测的平均值减弱短时噪声。窗口越大，曲线越平稳，但对真实变化的响应也越慢。遇到缺失值时必须约定分母使用窗口宽度还是有效观测数量。",
    "text_level": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      231,
      928,
      285
    ],
    "page_idx": 4
  },
  {
    "type": "equation",
    "img_path": "images/f18a97d84ffb0d96b676f75157708a2a81dec2724a4a2d8cc4ecabe22a5f646a.png",
    "text": "$$\nm_t = \\frac{1}{w}\\sum_{i=0}^{w-1} x_{t-i}\n$$",
    "text_format": "latex",
    "bbox": [
      72,
      299,
      928,
      353
    ],
    "page_idx": 4
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "img_path": "images/b72ebf3fe8f3e8f54290295f249a15391c55c8c7a677b0caa0594528e672f01b.png",
    "image_caption": [
      "图 1 原始读数与三点移动平均的示意"
    ],
    "image_footnote": [],
    "content": "",
    "bbox": [
      72,
      367,
      928,
      421
    ],
    "page_idx": 4
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "平滑后的值适合观察趋势，但不应覆盖原始数据。诊断传感器故障时仍要回查原始读数和质量标记。",
    "text_level": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      435,
      928,
      489
    ],
    "page_idx": 4
  },
  {
    "type": "header",
    "text": "COURSE STUDIO / 传感器数据校验入门",
    "bbox": [
      65,
      24,
      600,
      48
    ],
    "page_idx": 4
  },
  {
    "type": "footer",
    "text": "原创测试教材 · 仿 MinerU 结构化产物",
    "bbox": [
      65,
      948,
      610,
      972
    ],
    "page_idx": 4
  },
  {
    "type": "page_number",
    "text": "5",
    "bbox": [
      900,
      948,
      940,
      972
    ],
    "page_idx": 4
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "2.2 阈值与迟滞",
    "text_level": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      95,
      928,
      149
    ],
    "page_idx": 5
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "只有一个阈值时，读数在阈值附近轻微波动会让告警反复开关。迟滞使用进入阈值和退出阈值形成缓冲区：高于 80 开启告警，低于 75 才解除。",
    "text_level": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      163,
      928,
      217
    ],
    "page_idx": 5
  },
  {
    "type": "table",
    "img_path": "images/c19905c3ac4cd095ca273d81019290c8333577dc79889d55af69e6acafa57a69.png",
    "table_caption": [
      "表 2 告警状态迁移"
    ],
    "table_footnote": [],
    "table_body": "<table><thead><tr><th>当前状态</th><th>条件</th><th>下一状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>正常</td><td>值 > 80</td><td>告警</td></tr><tr><td>正常</td><td>值 ≤ 80</td><td>正常</td></tr><tr><td>告警</td><td>值 < 75</td><td>正常</td></tr><tr><td>告警</td><td>值 ≥ 75</td><td>告警</td></tr></tbody></table>",
    "bbox": [
      72,
      231,
      928,
      285
    ],
    "page_idx": 5
  },
  {
    "type": "code",
    "sub_type": "algorithm",
    "code_caption": [
      "算法 1 带迟滞的状态更新"
    ],
    "code_body": "if not alarm and value > 80:\n    alarm = True\nelif alarm and value < 75:\n    alarm = False",
    "code_footnote": [],
    "bbox": [
      72,
      299,
      928,
      353
    ],
    "page_idx": 5
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "边界检查",
    "text_level": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      367,
      928,
      421
    ],
    "page_idx": 5
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "等于 80 或 75 时的行为必须由比较符号明确表达。测试既要覆盖越过阈值，也要覆盖恰好等于阈值。",
    "text_level": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72,
      435,
      928,
      489
    ],
    "page_idx": 5
  },
